    <!-- PROFILE -->

    <div class="profile-layout" id="character">

        <div class="profile-main">

            <div class="character-title searchable">
                <small>CHARACTER PROFILE / 001</small>
                <h1>Elfaria Albis Serfort</h1>
                <p>❄ Ice Magic · One of the Magia Vander</p>
            </div>

            <!-- APPEARANCE -->

            <section class="content-section searchable" id="appearance">
                <h2><span>❄</span> Appearance</h2>

                <p>
                    Elfaria has blue eyes and long light blue hair.
                    She wears the Holy Shroud of Diamond Dust, a gold
                    trimmed white dress consisting of the main dress
                    with a diamond shaped crystal above her chest,
                    knee covers, and a cloak that stretches down
                    from her upper arms.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- PERSONALITY -->

            <section class="content-section searchable" id="personality">
                <h2><span>♡</span> Personality</h2>

                <p>
                    Since she knew him from childhood, Elfaria is one
                    of the few people that doesn’t look down on Will,
                    telling him that he was kind and was braver than
                    others. Far from it even, she seems to show an
                    almost obsessive and intense affection for him,
                    as ever since she was a child, she felt as if he
                    was her other half she needed.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Her love for Will is still very much intact even
                    years after their separation, as it's shown she
                    sleeps with dolls modeled after him and even
                    openly admits her love for Will against Zeo and
                    claims she would protect Will as he was her bride.
                </p>

                <p>
                    When it comes to herself, Elfaria is also
                    extremely childish, and lazy, even being called
                    "The Embodiment of Laziness" within the Tower,
                    as she holds no real interest in affairs in
                    the Tower, and spends nearly all her time,
                    either sleeping or watching Will's actions from
                    above the Tower, a fact that makes her second
                    in command, Sarissa, deeply exhausted.
                </p>

                <p>
                    She is widely seen as a saint, as a personal image
                    she has crafted, but the ones closest to her are
                    very aware that it's a simple facade. While she
                    is mostly inactive in affairs regarding the Tower,
                    she is very active in affairs regarding Will
                    whether it be in the past or present.
                </p>

                <p>
                    She admits that she has a strong desire to
                    monopolize Will's attention, and did whatever
                    she could in the past to get it, even though
                    it was embarrassing for that to be exposed to
                    the school, during the Grand Magic Festival.
                    Because of her love and obsessive nature, she is
                    also deeply jealous of other people being close
                    to Will or attracted to him, such as Iris claiming
                    she could take Will in or Zeo claiming Will for
                    his faction, in which both cases Elfaria lashed
                    out, her jealousy in plain sight.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Despite leaving Regarden far earlier, she is
                    shown to still be waiting for Will to fulfill
                    their childhood promise to become Magia Vander
                    and see the sunset atop the tower together,
                    stating that she'd wait for him as long as
                    necessary.
                </p>

                <p>
                    She is shown to tell certain people about Will
                    as Iris became interested in him after hearing
                    about him from the former. She was shown to get
                    embarrassed when Will revealed an embarrassing
                    moment from her past, asking Sarissa if there
                    was any magic to redo the past or remove
                    memories from people.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- RELATIONSHIPS -->

            <section class="content-section searchable" id="relationships">
                <h2><span>♡</span> Relationships</h2>

                <div class="relationship-grid">
                    <div class="relationship-card">
                        <small>Love Interest</small>
                        <strong>Will Sefort</strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relationship-card">
                        <small>Assistant</small>
                        <strong>Sarissa Alfeld</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>

        <!-- CHARACTER CARD -->

        <aside class="info-card">

